		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιβό-βωτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cried out against, ill spoken of</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί</span>
